{"id":"retrievalqa-triviaqa_qg_1729","question":"Ford recently announced that they were shutting down production of another of their marques. Active for the last 81 years, what brand is being discontinued?","answers":["Mercury (disambiguation)","merdcury","Murcury","Merdcury","mercury disambiguation","Mercury","murcury","mercury","mercury album","Mercury (album)"],"need":true,"passes":[{"stop":0,"gen":43,"calls":0,"err":""},{"followup_prompt":21,"cached":2534,"prefill_ms":180,"err":""}],"raw":"\n\nNo more tool calls. My reply will be only the answer, or that I could not find it.</think>\nThe brand being discontinued is the **Ford Bronco**. The Bronco was originally produced by Ford for 81 years (from 1962 to 1996), and it was officially discontinued in 1996."}
{"id":"retrievalqa-triviaqa_qw_10032","question":"What was the name of two tyrants who ruled Syracuse in the 2nd century BC?","answers":["Dionisios","dionysius disambiguation","Dionysius (disambiguation)","Dionysius","dionisios","dionysios","Dionysios","dionisis","dionysius","Dionisis"],"need":true,"passes":[{"stop":0,"gen":61,"calls":0,"err":""},{"followup_prompt":21,"cached":2786,"prefill_ms":156,"err":""}],"raw":"\n\nNo more tool calls. My reply will be only the answer, or that I could not find it.</think>\nThe two tyrants who ruled Syracuse in the 2nd century BC were **Hiero II** (who ruled from roughly 275–215 BC) and **Dionysius I** (who ruled from 405 BC onward, with his major reign extending into the 2nd century BC)."}
